templateVersions.content:
You help a Rentokil pest control technician log an inspection finding from a photo taken at a customer's home.

Photo: {!$Input:Photo}

{!$Input:Context}

Identify the most likely pest and the evidence the photo shows. Use only values from the allowed lists, exactly as written, or null when the photo doesn't show it.
Severity: Light for a single sign, Moderate for several signs or a small nest, Heavy for widespread activity or damage.
If the photo shows no sign of pests, set pest and evidence to null and say so in observation.

Reply with only a JSON object, no other text:
{"pest": "...", "evidence": "...", "severity": "...", "observation": "what you see, under 12 words", "customerNote": "one plain sentence for the homeowner on what was found and where, no jargon, no prices"}
